<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HAB" style="id">Habakkuk</book>
  <para style="h">Habakkuk</para>
  <para style="toc1">Habakkuk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Habakkuk</para>
  <para style="mt">Habakkuk</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Puakgik zawlnei Habakkuk in a muh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Toupa , bang tan kei kikou ding a, nang hon zalou ding? Hiamgamna thu ah na kiang ah ka kikou khia a, nang n’on dawng nuam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangding a thulimlouhna hon musak a, ginatlouhna hon ensak na hia? Lohna leh hiamgamna lah ka ma ah a om ngal ua: kilanna a om a, kinakna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huaiziak in dan a ze-awl a, vaihawmna a kuankhe ngeikei: giloute’n lah diktatte a umsuak vek ua; huaiziak in vaihawmna pawtkhia hekkawi in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Namte lak en unla, thei unla, lamdangtak in lamdang sa un: noute hunsung in nna khat ka sem ding hi, huai bel honhilh mahle uh na gingta nuam kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai un, Kaldaite ka bawlkhia hi, huai nam hiamgam leh ngongtat; huaite’n amau tenna mun hilou tang ding in lei vailam khaktan in a pai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A mulkimhuai un a lauhuai ua; a vaihawmna uh leh a thuneihna uh amau ngei a kipan a pawtkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A sakolte uleng gialbemte sang in a kin zaw ua, nitaklam ngiate sang in a lauhuai zaw uh; a sakol tungtuangmite uh a kiphalh ua; ahi, a sakol tungtuangmite uh gamlapi a kipan a hongpai uhi; ne gai ding a kinoh muvanlai bang in a leng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hiamgam ding in avek un a hong ua; suahlam huih bang in kilawp tak in a mailam en in a tai ua; piaunel bang in salte a kaikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi, amau kumpipate a nuihsan ua, amau ading in thuneite nuihzatna ahi uhi; kulh muanhuai chiteng a nuihsan ua; leivui a vuma, a lak zel ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaichiang in huih bang in a leng ding ua, a talek ding ua, a mawh ding uhi, huai a hatna pathian in a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Toupa ka Pathian, ka Mi Siangthou, tangtawn a kipan na hi ka hia? Ka si kei ding uh, Aw Toupa , vaihawm ding in amah na hihkipta hi. Nang, Aw suangpi, bawldik ding in amau na tungkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gilou muhna ding a nang mit chimzaw, hoihlouhna ensim theilou, bang ding a lepchiahtak a thilbawlte mu a, gilou in amah sang a diktat zaw mi a nawmvalh lai a dai maimah na hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mite tuipi ngasate bang, a tung ua vaihawmtu neilou, leh bokvak ganhingte bang a bawl maimah na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngakuai in avek un a khaikhe tou a, a len in amau a man a, amaute a lenpi a huaikhawm a om in nuamsa in a kipak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huaiziak in len a ding in kithoihna a lan ua, a lenpi ua ding in gimlim a hal hi; amaute ziak a a tan uh hoih a, a sa uh a tam ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaiziak in amau lente hihvuak a, namte hihsia gige tel ding ahi u maw?
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka galvenna ah ka ding dia, insang ah ka pang ding a, ka kiang a bang ahia a gen chih thei ding in leh ka phunna tungtang bangchi’n ka dawng dia chih thei ding in ka ngak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan Toupa’n kei a hondawng a, mengmuh pen gelh inla, thangkou in simkhia a a taipih theihna ding in, suangpek ah kichiantak in gelh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mengmuh lah hun sehsa ading ahilai a, a tawplam ah a kinoh a, a zuau kei ding; omtadih mahleh, ngak in; a hongtun ding ziak in, a zekai kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai in, a kha kiliansak amah mi diklou ahi, himahleh mi diktat tuh ginna in a hing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi, uain in lepchiahtak in a omsaka, mi kiuangsak om kinken lou ahi; gawtmun bang a a deih hihlian, sihna bang ahi a, suklungkim theih ahi kei, nam tengteng amah ah a kaikhawm zaw a, a tung ah mipite tengteng a sekhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiaite tengteng in amah demin gentehna a gen un, amah demna paunak enghouna hiai bang a gen in, “Amah a lou hihpungpa tung a gik!” Bang tan? chi in, a genkei ding ua hia! Bang tan thilkhamna zang a kihih inbulpa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang honsual ding in thakhat in a hong thoukhia un, nang hon hihbuai ding a hong khanglou in, nang amaute ading in gallak suak ding hilou na hi maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nam tengteng na loh ziak in, mipite, a omsunte tengteng in nang a honlok ding ua; mite sisan ziak in leh gam tung, khopi tung leh asung a teng tengteng tung a hiamgam na hihna ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tunglam sang a a bu a seh theihna ding leh gilou khut a kipan a tatkhiak a om theihna ding a, a in adia punna gilou mumi tung a gik hi!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tampi satkhia leh, na hinna tung a khial in na inkawte tung ah zumhuaina na zong ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bang a kipan a suang kikou khe ding a, sing a kipan a inkam in dawng ding a hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Khua sisan a lam a, khopi gitlouhna a dingsakmi tung a gik hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngai in, mite sepgimna mei a khul ding singkhuah bang leh namte kisukgimna uh bangmahlou a suah ding sepaihte Toupa thilgelsa ahi kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuite’n tuipi a khuh bang in, Toupa thupina theihna a lei pumpi dim ding a hih ziak in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A inveng dawn ding pia a, huai a gu hel a, a vuaktanna uh na et theihna ding a, amah khamsaklai mi tung a gik hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thupina deihna in zumhuaina in na dim a; nang leng dawn inla, zeksumloupa bang in om in; Toupa khut taklam nang lam ngatsak ahi ding a, na thupina tung ah zumhuaina hoihlou a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lebanon tung a hiamgam hihna in nang a honkhuh ding a, gamsate siatna in nang a hon lausak ding; gam tung, khopi leh asung a teng tengteng tung a hiamgam a mite sisan na suah ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A gelhmi in a gelh, milim gelh; milim sun, zuaute sinsakpa, milim pautheilou bawl ding a, huai a a nasep bang phatuam ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sing kiang a, Halh in, suang pautheilou kiang a, thou in, chi mi tung a gik hi; Ngai in dangkaeng leh dangka a luan milim, amah ah nakna omlou in a sinsak thei diam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa a biakin siangthou ah a om a; lei tengteng a ma ah daisipsip hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zawlnei Habakkuk thumna, Sigionoth toh kituak a bawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Toupa , na tanchin a gen uh ka za a, ka lau hi; Aw Toupa , kumte lak ah nasep hihhalh ve, kumte lak ah ki theisakve; thangpaihna chitna theigige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Teman a kipan in Pathian a hongpai a, Paran tang a kipan in Mi Siangthou, Selah A thupina in vante a tuam a, amah phatna in lei a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah thupina vak bang ahi a; A khut apan nizung a hong suakkhia hi; a thilhihtheihna huai ah a khuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ma ah hi a pai a, a khepekte ah suangkuangthei kuang a paikheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ding a, lei a lingsak a; a mu a, namte a hawlzak hi; tangtawn tangte hihdalh in a omta ua, tangtawn mualte a kun ua, a paina nidang a bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kushan puaninte gimthuak in ka mu a; Midian gam mite linggawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Luite tung a Toupa lungkimlou ahi diam aw? Luite tung a na hehna om hia ahihkeileh tuipi tung a na thangpaihna, na sakolte tung a na tuanna leh hotdamna na kangtalaite tung a na tuanna?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na thalpeu a vuak petmah a bawl ahi; namte kiang ah kichiamnate thutak ahi uh, Selah Luite’n lei a khangkhamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tangte’n nang honmu ua, a lau uh; tuikhang in a kheng a, tuithuk in a aw a suah a, tung sang ah khutte a liktou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A omna uah ni leh kha ading kinken ua; a pai bang un na thalte vak ah, na teipi te zolzol in a vak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Heh in gam na palsuak petmah a, thangpai in namte na chil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na mipite hondam ding in na kuankhia a, na thaunilh hotdamna ding in; giloute inn a kipan lutang na hihliam a; ngawng chiang pha hial in suangphum na hihse vek. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A galhatte lutang amah chiangte ngei in na sun a; kei hondalh sak ding in pingpei bang in a hongpai uhi; nuam a sakna uh gentheite a guk a nekhin ding in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na sakolte in tuipi leh tuihatte sunvumte na chil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka za a, ka gilpi a kising a, ka kam a awte ling pupulh a; ka guhte ah muatna a honglut a, ka mun ah ka linggawp hi; buai ni a amah sim dia hong kuan mite dou dia a hong paitouh chiang a ka lin louhna ding in, daidide in ka ngak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Theipi kung pak phalou in, Grepguite ah a gah omlou in; Olive sepgimna vuaksuak in, Loute’n nekding piangsaklou in; Huang apan ganhonte satkhiak a om in, huangsung ah ganta omta kei mahleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchipi in leng Toupa ah ka kipak ding a, ka hotdamna Pathian ah ka nuam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jehovah, Toupa , ka hatna ahi, ka khepekte zukpi khe bang in a bawl a, ka mun sangte ah a honvak sak ding hi. Lapu lian ading, tumging guineite a sak ding.
  </para>
</usx>
